{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-shadow-price-continuity","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:shadow-price-continuity","kind":"proposition","title":"Continuity of shadow prices on the generic locus","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-local-shadow-ordering"],"tags":["shadow-price","continuity","rational-function","generic-locus"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.ShadowPriceContinuity","text":"shadow-price-continuity.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/shadow-price-continuity.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:shadow-price-continuity\"></a><p><em>Each shadow price <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_\\lambda(q) = w_\\lambda(q)/d_\\lambda(q) - 1/[k]_q!</code> is a <strong>rational function</strong> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> over the base ring, with denominator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[k]_q! \\cdot d_\\lambda(q)</code>. On the generic locus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\{q : [k]_q! \\cdot d_\\lambda(q) \\neq 0\\}</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_\\lambda</code> is continuous in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> (smooth in the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{R}</code> realisation, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code>-adic continuous in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}_p</code>, well-defined Zariski on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{F}_p</code>).</em></p>\n<p><em>By continuity, if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">|y_{\\lambda_1}(q)| &#x3C; |y_{\\lambda_2}(q)|</code> strictly, then the <a href=\"#def:local-shadow-ordering\">local shadow-price ordering</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_1 \\preceq_q \\lambda_2</code> holds on a neighborhood.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/shadow-price-continuity.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"12.4.7"}
